<http://data.silknow.org/object/144897a9-54c7-3882-ab65-52b09711488c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: linen with threads drawn in both directions. Design: band with zig-zag formed by crossed lines with ends worked with reddish orange silk outlined with black silk whipped over foundation threads to form a mesh. The lighter ground is in part darned linen, in part a square mesh whipped over with light orange, and light green silk. Above and below, a narrow band of linen with black and reddish orange silk in straight stitches. Three pieces sewed together."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a0872f04-f01c-30bb-9c18-1f7ab8d60416> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Ground: linen with threads drawn in both directions. Design: band with zig-zag formed by crossed lines with ends worked with reddish orange silk outlined with black silk whipped over foundation threads to form a mesh. The lighter ground is in part darned linen, in part a square mesh whipped over with light orange, and light green silk. Above and below, a narrow band of linen with black and reddish orange silk in straight stitches. Three pieces sewed together."@en ;
